1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,179
Slim: Welcome to the toll road. The toll
is everything you own.

2
00:00:04,499 --> 00:00:07,985
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part eight of ten: the toll.

3
00:00:08,305 --> 00:00:11,458
Rosa: Brake. Slowly. Nobody speak.

4
00:00:11,778 --> 00:00:15,696
Slim: Food, fuel, medicine. And that
lovely bus.

5
00:00:16,016 --> 00:00:19,465
Dante: Gentlemen. I have a legendary sword
in my inventory.

6
00:00:19,785 --> 00:00:20,447
Slim: Your what?

7
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:21,816
Dante: ...A big stick.

8
00:00:21,936 --> 00:00:22,929
Slim: That's not a sword.

9
00:00:23,249 --> 00:00:28,157
Slim: And nobody bitten crosses my road.
Everybody out. Sleeves up.

10
00:00:28,277 --> 00:00:29,017
Priya: Not again.

11
00:00:29,337 --> 00:00:30,864
June: Young man, have you eaten?

12
00:00:30,984 --> 00:00:31,961
Slim: ...Is that cherry?

13
00:00:32,081 --> 00:00:33,429
June: Fresh this morning.

14
00:00:33,749 --> 00:00:35,087
Raider: This one's dead, boss.

15
00:00:35,207 --> 00:00:36,275
Walt: I'm retired.

16
00:00:36,595 --> 00:00:38,451
Priya: Noise is a weapon, if you aim it.

17
00:00:38,571 --> 00:00:39,221
Rosa: Aim.

18
00:00:39,541 --> 00:00:42,804
Slim: Is that...? My pie! RUN!

19
00:00:45,724 --> 00:00:48,731
BUS-E: Toll paid. Thank you for choosing
the Last Bus.

20
00:00:49,051 --> 00:00:51,396
Priya: Rosa? Rosa!

21
00:00:51,516 --> 00:00:52,445
Rosa: Not now.

22
00:00:52,765 --> 00:00:55,177
Priya: Pull over. I need to see your hand.

23
00:00:55,297 --> 00:00:56,002
Rosa: ...Okay.

24
00:00:56,322 --> 00:01:01,063
BUS-E: Part eight of ten, The Last Bus.
Next: the glove. Follow for part nine.

